    <h2>How we compare lenders</h2>
    <p>Every page uses the same yardsticks: published rate ranges, maximum leverage (LTC and ARV), loan size limits, whether a true 30-year DSCR product exists, closing speed, and any new-customer incentive. Where lenders don't publish numbers, we use the ranges they quote publicly and flag them as typical. When Kiavi loses a category, the page says so. Start with our <a href="/kiavi-review/">full Kiavi review</a> if you want the baseline first.</p>
